{"3599470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Final Fall", "steam_appid": 3599470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Please read before you buy</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Final Fall</strong> is not for the average gamer. This project is raw, it's difficult, it has no map, and it absolutely refuses to hold your hand,  it features a very controversial subject matter like suicide without censorship. It's about telling a serious story, not about jump scares. If those things bother you, this game might not be for you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Fall</strong> is a psychological horror game about schizophrenia, trauma, and the monsters we carry inside. You play as <strong>Ophelia</strong>, a woman with no memory after a failed suicide attempt, lost in a crumbling asylum filled with hallucinations, riddles, and voices that won’t stop whispering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the brutal physical manifestation of Ophelia's most sadistic tormentor, her own mind, in a timing based intense combat that can have only one winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/ed6d7e81d99cb15a2e6ef9ae69a7781d.poster.avif?t=1778185241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/ed6d7e81d99cb15a2e6ef9ae69a7781d.webm?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/ed6d7e81d99cb15a2e6ef9ae69a7781d.mp4?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world shaped by Ophelia’s fractured mind. As her sanity slips, the hospital twists around her. Walls bend, whispers grow louder, and reality becomes impossible to trust. Solve brutal puzzles, survive disturbing hallucinations, and confront terrifying creatures born from her guilt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/78fa05f4b2e6e3c0ee947cfd40e6c864.poster.avif?t=1778185241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/78fa05f4b2e6e3c0ee947cfd40e6c864.webm?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/78fa05f4b2e6e3c0ee947cfd40e6c864.mp4?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suicide isn’t just a backstory</strong>, it’s a mechanic. Misusing items or failing in key moments may push Ophelia to end her life. Do it three times… and your save file is permanently deleted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/049dab20677f5226304ddb8de942c04a.poster.avif?t=1778185241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/049dab20677f5226304ddb8de942c04a.webm?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/049dab20677f5226304ddb8de942c04a.mp4?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity-Driven World</strong> – The hospital reacts to Ophelia’s mental state, changing the environment as her mind deteriorates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hallucinatory Enemies</strong> – Monsters aren’t real… or are they? Fight distorted manifestations of her trauma.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Scarcity</strong> – Pills and healing items are rare. Use them wisely, or suffer the consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Puzzles</strong> – Decode Morse code, solve twisted riddles, and manipulate real instruments like a completely playable piano. (Yes you can actually play piano)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Death System</strong> – Suicides can cut Ophelia's story short, ending her story and taking your save file along with it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive her mind?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Please read before you buy</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Final Fall</strong> is not for the average gamer. This project is raw, it's difficult, it has no map, and it absolutely refuses to hold your hand,  it features a very controversial subject matter like suicide without censorship. It's about telling a serious story, not about jump scares. If those things bother you, this game might not be for you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Fall</strong> is a psychological horror game about schizophrenia, trauma, and the monsters we carry inside. You play as <strong>Ophelia</strong>, a woman with no memory after a failed suicide attempt, lost in a crumbling asylum filled with hallucinations, riddles, and voices that won’t stop whispering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the brutal physical manifestation of Ophelia's most sadistic tormentor, her own mind, in a timing based intense combat that can have only one winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/ed6d7e81d99cb15a2e6ef9ae69a7781d.poster.avif?t=1778185241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/ed6d7e81d99cb15a2e6ef9ae69a7781d.webm?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/ed6d7e81d99cb15a2e6ef9ae69a7781d.mp4?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world shaped by Ophelia’s fractured mind. As her sanity slips, the hospital twists around her. Walls bend, whispers grow louder, and reality becomes impossible to trust. Solve brutal puzzles, survive disturbing hallucinations, and confront terrifying creatures born from her guilt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/78fa05f4b2e6e3c0ee947cfd40e6c864.poster.avif?t=1778185241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/78fa05f4b2e6e3c0ee947cfd40e6c864.webm?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/78fa05f4b2e6e3c0ee947cfd40e6c864.mp4?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suicide isn’t just a backstory</strong>, it’s a mechanic. Misusing items or failing in key moments may push Ophelia to end her life. Do it three times… and your save file is permanently deleted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/049dab20677f5226304ddb8de942c04a.poster.avif?t=1778185241\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/049dab20677f5226304ddb8de942c04a.webm?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/049dab20677f5226304ddb8de942c04a.mp4?t=1778185241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity-Driven World</strong> – The hospital reacts to Ophelia’s mental state, changing the environment as her mind deteriorates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hallucinatory Enemies</strong> – Monsters aren’t real… or are they? Fight distorted manifestations of her trauma.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Scarcity</strong> – Pills and healing items are rare. Use them wisely, or suffer the consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Puzzles</strong> – Decode Morse code, solve twisted riddles, and manipulate real instruments like a completely playable piano. (Yes you can actually play piano)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Death System</strong> – Suicides can cut Ophelia's story short, ending her story and taking your save file along with it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive her mind?</p>", "short_description": "Final Fall is a psychological horror game about schizophrenia. Play as Ophelia, a woman with no memory after a failed suicide attempt. Solve brutal puzzles, survive hallucinations, and fight her inner demons. Suicide isn’t just backstory, it's gameplay. Resist or don't... Her life is in your hands.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“This production represents one of the bravest and most controversial offerings in contemporary psychological horror . Its raw approach to themes such as suicide and schizophrenia, combined with mechanics that narratively reinforce these elements, makes it an experience that transcends the traditional boundaries of entertainment.”<br>OneDigital<br><br>“Final Fall is a bold new game that challenges the conventions of horror games. With a deep narrative, innovative mechanics, and an immersive atmosphere, it is an experience that stays with the player long after the game is over. For those looking for a game that goes beyond superficial entertainment and delves into the depths of the human psyche, Final Fall is a must-see.”<br>GameHall<br><br>“Final Fall  doesn't soften anything. It shakes up, disturbs, and provokes. But it does so accurately, without ever betraying its subject. For those ready to confront their own darkness through Ophelia's eyes, it's a remarkable work, one that goes beyond the confines of a video game to become a dark mirror of the human soul.”<br>G Pour Geek<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/2dd6980da84201ce2f29fe6edde13732b3ef97cf/header.jpg?t=1778185241", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/e0dde36818c19a440fbbb12747a57521774a266e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778185241", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/e0dde36818c19a440fbbb12747a57521774a266e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778185241", "website": "https://finalfallgame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 2600x,  Intel i5 8600k <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060, AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5600x Intel i5-12400F or Better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 2070, RX 5700 XT or Better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Divider Studios"], "publishers": ["Divider Studios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1269533], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Final Fall", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1269533, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Final Fall - $9.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 999}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/d54e61793a7adec1da4e290a24114647bd7c25f7/ss_d54e61793a7adec1da4e290a24114647bd7c25f7.600x338.jpg?t=1778185241", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a